Ungate text-anchor and dominant-baseline in stylo's Servo build.

This targets the STYLO repository (https://github.com/servo/stylo), not
servo -- it sits outside the numbered servo series, like stylo-0001,
stylo-0002 and stylo-0003.

Both are behind #[cfg(feature = "gecko")], so Servo cannot see either.
text-anchor is the one that matters: it decides which part of a text run
lands on the element's x/y, and without it every centred or right-
anchored SVG label draws left-aligned, which is most of what a diagram's
labels are. dominant-baseline is the vertical equivalent. Neither has
Gecko-specific machinery behind it -- text-anchor is a three-value
keyword and dominant-baseline a plain enum -- so the gate looks like an
artefact of Gecko having been the only consumer.

This is the fourth pair of SVG properties found gated this way, after
pointer-events (stylo-0002) and stop-color/stop-opacity (stylo-0003).
Worth ungating as a group upstream rather than one patch at a time.

Consumed by servo patch 0020, which maps both as presentation attributes
and applies text-anchor when positioning a shaped run.

To try it: check out stylo at the rev pinned in servo's Cargo.lock,
apply, and add a [patch."https://github.com/servo/stylo"] section
redirecting all eleven stylo-repo crates at the local checkout.

diff --git a/style/properties/longhands.toml b/style/properties/longhands.toml
index 27d96b253..e6153dcbc 100644
--- a/style/properties/longhands.toml
+++ b/style/properties/longhands.toml
@@ -1955,7 +1955,6 @@ affects = "layout"
 type = "Color"
 initial = "computed::Color::BLACK"
 struct = "svg"
-engine = "gecko"
 spec = "https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/pservers.html#StopColorProperties"
 affects = "paint"
 
@@ -1963,7 +1962,6 @@ affects = "paint"
 type = "Opacity"
 initial = "1.0"
 struct = "svg"
-engine = "gecko"
 spec = "https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/pservers.html#StopOpacityProperty"
 affects = "paint"
 
@@ -3858,7 +3856,6 @@ keyword = { values = ["from-image", "none"] }
 
 [text-anchor]
 struct = "inherited_svg"
-engine = "gecko"
 spec = "https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/text.html#TextAnchorProperty"
 animation_type = "discrete"
 affects = "layout"
@@ -4199,7 +4196,6 @@ keyword = { values = ["normal", "multiply", "screen", "overlay", "darken", "ligh
 type = "DominantBaseline"
 initial = "computed::DominantBaseline::Auto"
 struct = "inherited_box"
-engine = "gecko"
 animation_type = "discrete"
 spec = "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-inline-3/#dominant-baseline-property"
 affects = "layout"
